{"title":"AI-assisted time saved at work so far","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/917755703/0/marginalrevolution~AIassisted-time-saved-at-work-so-far.html","date":1746428470000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Between 1 and 5% of all work hours are currently assisted by generative AI, and respondents report time savings equivalent to 1.4% of total work hours.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is from <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LCW3Fo50Q790xUI6tvN8AgX7Vp7O_l7n/view?pli=1\" target=\"_blank\">a 2025 paper</a> by Alexander Bick, Adam Blandin, and David J. Deming.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/ai-assisted-time-saved-at-work-so-far.html\">AI-assisted time saved at work so far</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/917755703/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/917755703/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/917755703/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/917755703/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/917755703/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/917755703/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/ai-assisted-time-saved-at-work-so-far.html#comments\"><img